title The ledger reads clean -- the two exiled reds heal where they lie, and open_rows reads zero across the spine
prompt Keaton's kg with the recommended doors granted: the exiled-reds homecoming and %338's closure. N=3752 gave fire a fourth time, and the advance-by-hand clause (seated in the Silence prompt) turned the wheel to earth, the least-recently-read row.
think Earth's second orbit turn, applied rather than reread: the dual seat IS this lap -- a BOOKED or CLOSED marker is a marked value, the kind carried on the value itself and read at the door -- and the smell-test was reading both shelf rows whole before moving anything. The read changed the plan for the better: no row needed to come home. %337's OPEN half was a ratchet this very day drained to zero (the witness-own-build family closed at ceiling 0 with %334, Silence's lap), leaving only the booked scan-widening lap -- BOOKED. %338's OPEN half was the deadlock itself, and door B was its repair, landed this hour -- CLOSED.
think The mechanism: one status marker APPENDED to each shelf row -- accretion, the ledger's own lawful status life, with the three testimony fields untouched -- rather than a physical move that would have bred duplicate rows and breached two shelf headers. %338's own elder sentence predicted shelf_open_rows falls to zero the day the pin can hold both; it fell to zero by healing in place instead, which is the gentler reading of the same prophecy. The capacity scan's SHELF_OPEN_ROWS_CEILING falls 2 to 0, a ceiling that only falls, lowered on the lap the repair landed as its own instruction asks.
obs The spine now reads: open_rows=0, booked_rows=9, closed_rows=37, pin 0 plus shelf 0 equals spine 0, verdict every_status_agrees; capacity witness GREEN, monotone GREEN. Zero open reds across the entire ledger for the first time in its recorded life -- every defect either closed on a witness or BOOKED with its remainder named and kept exactly as live as it was (four seats and %291's one-tree-or-a-lock await Keaton's word; %311 turns on touch; %301's five folds, %330's rename, and %337's scan-widening stay booked laps).
obs One assertion refused mid-lap and taught the usual lesson: the %338 append anchored on a tail the bold had already closed before -- read the actual bytes, then write. A small door left honestly open: the two shelf headers still read "never edited" while their rows now carry accreted markers; the tree's own vocabulary (accretion is not editing -- accrete-never-break) resolves it, and a one-line header softening can ride any future touch of those shelves.
